Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:53:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] lsfg-vk step 2b: port mipmaps and generate passes

- lsfg_mipmaps: flow-scaled mip chain (7 levels, R8) from the input frame pair.
- lsfg_generate: final blend pass writing into a caller-supplied storage image.
  Ends with a transition to TRANSFER_SRC_OPTIMAL (Eden leaves GENERAL) because Azahar's
  PresentWindow reads frames from that layout.
- lsfg_common: add AllocateLsfgDescriptorSets helper.

NOT COMPILED (see step 2a). Frame images must gain VK_IMAGE_USAGE_STORAGE_BIT in step 3.
